{"4216770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unanchored Spaceshooting", "steam_appid": 4216770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Connection Methods</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports Steam Remote Play Together, but if you experience severe lag or latency when using Remote Play Together, it is recommended to use third-party software for online play, such as Parsec.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to the official documentation for instructions on using Steam Remote Play Together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parsec Illustrated Tutorial</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/fa2119631a3504a7f020026d5137b1a5.avif?t=1785293987\" width=600 height=2210 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/cfc1d96b1e87a43a8d2a4cf5be4ccbbf.poster.avif?t=1785293987\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/cfc1d96b1e87a43a8d2a4cf5be4ccbbf.webm?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/cfc1d96b1e87a43a8d2a4cf5be4ccbbf.mp4?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance through gunfire—let recoil be your wings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In zero-G space, your weapon is your ONLY thruster! <i>Unanchored Spaceshooting</i> is a 1-3 player local co-op action shooter. Harness gun recoil to drift through weightless arenas—fight solo or team up to annihilate alien hordes and chase high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✓ Anti-gravity movement, counter-intuitive shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/03725f8f3e221ac8c62d2b8f7efe4cb4.poster.avif?t=1785293987\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/03725f8f3e221ac8c62d2b8f7efe4cb4.webm?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/03725f8f3e221ac8c62d2b8f7efe4cb4.mp4?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the weightless arena! Traditional controls are obsolete—your dual pistols are both weapons and thrusters. Want to float free? Fire all around! Want to dodge perfectly? Tap-fire to finesse your position!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✓Collect Points, Redeem Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/034a1fa536ede590987d36b1af5a17dd.poster.avif?t=1785293987\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/034a1fa536ede590987d36b1af5a17dd.webm?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/034a1fa536ede590987d36b1af5a17dd.mp4?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use points to redeem items in the store! From ammo boosts to shields, from health recovery to faster reloads!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✓ Solo &amp; co-op gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/b3f4ec9bfa28a7f1cfc7c73707e7e9f9.poster.avif?t=1785293987\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/b3f4ec9bfa28a7f1cfc7c73707e7e9f9.webm?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/b3f4ec9bfa28a7f1cfc7c73707e7e9f9.mp4?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemy waves alone or team up on the same screen! Survival demands efficiency—clear enemies, maintain combos, and master positioning. Fast-paced combat and alien octopus enemies spawning from all directions make every round unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✓ Journey through space, roam the orbits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/0ccc93753deeb3afb2b374c924ff0cee.poster.avif?t=1785293987\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/0ccc93753deeb3afb2b374c924ff0cee.webm?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/0ccc93753deeb3afb2b374c924ff0cee.mp4?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across multiple dynamic maps built on orbital mechanics. Each ring and orbit is a unique arena with distinct gravity fields, environmental hazards, and stunning celestial scenery.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/cfc1d96b1e87a43a8d2a4cf5be4ccbbf.poster.avif?t=1785293987\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/cfc1d96b1e87a43a8d2a4cf5be4ccbbf.webm?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/cfc1d96b1e87a43a8d2a4cf5be4ccbbf.mp4?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance through gunfire—let recoil be your wings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In zero-G space, your weapon is your ONLY thruster! <i>Unanchored Spaceshooting</i> is a 1-3 player local co-op action shooter. Harness gun recoil to drift through weightless arenas—fight solo or team up to annihilate alien hordes and chase high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✓ Anti-gravity movement, counter-intuitive shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/03725f8f3e221ac8c62d2b8f7efe4cb4.poster.avif?t=1785293987\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/03725f8f3e221ac8c62d2b8f7efe4cb4.webm?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216770/extras/03725f8f3e221ac8c62d2b8f7efe4cb4.mp4?t=1785293987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the weightless arena! Traditional controls are obsolete—your dual pistols are both weapons and thrusters. Want to float free? Fire all around! Want to dodge perfectly? Tap-fire to finesse your position!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✓Collect Points, Redeem Items</s